{"overview":"داستان واقعی قهرمان پلیس مواد مخدر که به مدافع بازتوانی تبدیل شد، کوین سیمرز و دخترش بروک. این فیلم بحران مواد مخدر در آمریکا و «خط نازک آبی» را از نگاه متقابل پلیس و معتاد که همچنین پدر و دختر بودند، بررسی می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The true story of hero drug cop turned recovery advocate Kevin Simmers and his daughter Brooke. The film examines the American drug crisis and \"the thin blue line\" from the opposing eyes of cop and addict who were also father and daughter.","tagline_en":"","runtime":108,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Jake Allyn"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"زاک براف","role":"Kevin Simmers","photo":"/koIHwqE6hWIXuOIDHNADwSuGq6N.jpg","en":"Zach Braff"},{"name":"استر-رز مک‌گرگور","role":"Brooke Simmers","photo":"/9iIlxW3QqkrTrA3oBqzTKH3b8pe.jpg","en":"Esther McGregor"},{"name":"ابیگیل اسپنسر","role":"Dana","photo":"/uf96FDHVoFMwoiP5He4SPLCmwri.jpg","en":"Abigail Spencer"},{"name":"لوکاس تیل","role":"Deputy Dormer","photo":"/5m8xgsOgT3FgCBo2AsMn7dewe57.jpg","en":"Lucas Till"},{"name":"Abigail Rhyne","role":"Mandy","photo":"/46PC8XO46NIFz7FB9IcUdwXg04F.jpg"},{"name":"هولت مک‌کالانی","role":"David Trone","photo":"/b1FEXFQ8ZnvXhVrMqCv5mTJ8aW3.jpg","en":"Holt McCallany"}],"trailer":"p0izMCPGdGE","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1452110-clean-hands/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"rent","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"rent","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"},{"n":"YouTube","kind":"rent","logo":"/5Maob4o5w8oZnNeYpCDyVFD3M7X.png"},{"n":"Fandango At Home","kind":"rent","logo":"/wpOt6x0dRxTrIzuBosto4LGd7E9.png"},{"n":"Plex","kind":"rent","logo":"/blAEhvx3XX8sV0fFVFk88FFjubs.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1452110-clean-hands/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"rent","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"rent","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UY